    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d302">

                <pb facs="0258" n="184" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg184"/>

                <head>Sir F. Bruce to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-07-26"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 26, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Sir Frederick Bruce presents his compliments to Mr. Seward, and begs to enclose a
                    copy of a resolution<anchor n="*" xml:id="d302-f1"/> passed by the grand
                    division of the Order of the Sons of Temperance of the province of Canada,
                    wherein they offer congratulations on the successful termination of the civil
                    war in this country, and at the same time express their sympathy with the
                    national bereavement.</p>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Horn <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
